:: Go upstairs {"position":"1975,1525","size":"100,100"}
You went upstairs. There are at least 10 rooms with 3 of them being free.
<div class="UIButtons">
<<button "Rent a room">>
<<if $Coins >= 100>>
	<<set $Coins -= 100>>
	<<set $paidForInn1 to true>>
    <<set $timeRemember.Inn1H to setup.datesystems.default.getDate().h>> 
    <<set $timeRemember.Inn1D to setup.datesystems.default.getDate().d + 1>> 
	<<goto "Go upstairs">>
<<elseif $paidForInn1 == true>>
	<<script>>
		UI.alert("You already rented a room!");
	<</script>>
<<elseif $Coins <= 99>>
	<<script>>
		UI.alert("You dont have enough col!");
	<</script>>
<</if>>
<</button>>
</div>
<<if $paidForInn1 == true>>
You can:
1. <<link [[Go to your Inn room.|Inn room]]>>
<<set $lastVisitedPassage1 to "Inn room">>
<</link>>
<<elseif $paidForInn1 == false>>
1. Renting a room costs: 100 col per day.
<</if>>\
2. <<link [[Go back|Inn 1]]>> <<dateadd '1m'>> <</link>>


